<Layout title="About | ZTEIST" lang="en">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-zte-navy">About Us</h1>
    <p class="mb-10 text-lg font-medium text-zte-blue">A Letter to the ZTE Family — Come Home, Then Set Off Together</p>

    <p class="mb-8">ZTEIST is a non-profit, volunteer-run community for everyone who has been part of ZTE. The name says it all: “ZTE” plus the suffix “-ist” — “a ZTE person”.</p>

    <p class="mb-6 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">Welcome home.</p>

    <p class="mb-6">Whenever you left ZTE and wherever life has taken you, the bond of being a “ZTE friend” is the common thread woven through all of us — the professional rigor, the way of getting things done, and the unspoken understanding forged in the same culture. This is the most precious foundation of our community.</p>

    <p class="mb-6">We are more than a community built on nostalgia. Many alumni groups live in the past — sharing memories, reconnecting, catching up now and then. That is wonderful, but it is not enough. What we want is to make “coming home” a new beginning, not an ending.</p>

    <p class="mb-6">We believe that everyone who has come out of ZTE holds a key — technical ability, management experience, industry insight, or the resources and judgment earned through years of hard work. What we do is bring all those keys to the same table, so each one finds the lock it was meant to open.</p>

    <p class="mb-6">There are no spectator seats here. Everyone who walks in is a builder. Founders, investors, leaders at major companies, and those still searching for their direction — there are no bystanders here. We don’t do hollow networking or icebreakers that lead nowhere. We do one thing: make sure every member’s value is seen, needed, and amplified by the rest.</p>

    <p class="mb-4">“Create together, win together, achieve together” is not a slogan — it is the rule.</p>
    <ul class="mb-6 space-y-3 pl-0">
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Create together</span>: when your expertise meets someone else’s insight, new possibilities come to life.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Win together</span>: helping one person succeed is helping everyone succeed.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Achieve together</span>: we are measured not by whom we have met, but by what we have built together.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mb-6">We don’t chase scale. We pursue a single goal: that every member who walks in finds their place in this ecosystem.</p>

    <p class="mb-6">Behind you stands a community. Around you is an entire ecosystem. Ahead of you, endless possibility.</p>

    <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">Welcome home. Now, let’s set off together.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
